# CR 110.2a/608.3a through ControlSpellEffect.java: ai's Aethersnatch gains
# control of human's Grizzly Bears while it is a spell on the stack. The
# stack item and the card both change controller, so when the Bears resolve
# they enter the battlefield under ai's control, still owned by human.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 G
tapformana human 3 G
queue paygeneric G
castspell human 1
tapformana ai 4 U
tapformana ai 5 U
tapformana ai 6 U
tapformana ai 7 U
tapformana ai 8 U
tapformana ai 9 U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue targets 1
castspell ai 10
# Aethersnatch's SubAbility$ ChangeTargets | Optional$ True: decline, the
# Bears have no targets to change anyway.
queue confirmeffect false
resolvestack
